{"id":"vod_sn_38588","vodId":"38588","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"锁链战记：赫克瑟塔斯之光","name_cn":"锁链战记：赫克瑟塔斯之光","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1e4f0ded1933ea1ee5a6621edad3f468.jpg"},"summary":"スマートフォン向けゲームアプリ「チェインクロニクル」をテレビアニメ化し、放送に先駆けて劇場で上映するシリーズ全3章のうちの第1章。いくつかの領地に分かれ、それぞれの地に王をいだく最果ての大陸ユグド。各勢力による小競り合いはあるものの、王たちの円卓会議で選ばれた「盟王」により、各地の力関係はバランスを保っていた。しかし、そんなある日、ユグドに暗黒の魔物「黒の軍勢」が現れる。監督は「劇場版BLEACH ブリーチ」でキャラクターデザインや作画監督を務めた工藤昌史。アニメーション制作は「ルパン三世」のテレコム・アニメーションフィルムと「楽園追放 Expelled from Paradise」を手がけたグラフィニカ。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:53","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AesKZmPf701/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mtXLc8bdRH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BT4tFTd4Hx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PJfN4nQ1Ky1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KUfmM3t4RE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SN5BRXF2er1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uFGNHFTSyZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hVyDhZtEh01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zi0iwDUfeJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mTRr9bHTea1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aXu3xGgEDq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BcpJ04Ya181/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.103Z"}